OL,3,GNEWSASchool site change 'horrible and
OL,4,Achaotic', say parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of Newhaven pupils moved to an
OL,7,Falternative school site on safety
OL,8,Fgrounds have described dropping off and
OL,9,Fpicking up their children as "horrible"
OL,10,Fand "complete chaos".
OL,12,FYoungsters at the Breakwater Academy in
OL,13,FValley Road have been temporarily
OL,14,Frelocated to High Cliff Academy in
OL,15,FSouthdown Road after an assessment of
OL,16,Fthe building.
OL,18,FLewes MP James MacCleary has urged the
OL,19,Fschool to confirm a return to the
OL,20,FBreakwater site, as well as transport
OL,21,Farrangements and measures to manage
OL,22,Ftraffic and congestion.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
